            <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Ela aparece no topo do app e nas divisões de compra. Sem foto, o ícone do AcerttaPay segura a bronca bonitinho.</p>
          </div>

          <% const hasGoogleDefaultPhoto = !!(selfProfile && selfProfile.google_photo_url); %>
          <% const photoMode = (selfProfile && selfProfile.profile_photo_mode) || 'default'; %>
          <% const hasManualPhoto = photoMode === 'manual' && !!(selfProfile && selfProfile.profile_photo_url); %>
          <% const showUseDefaultButton = hasManualPhoto || (photoMode === 'none' && hasGoogleDefaultPhoto); %>
          <% const showRemoveButton = !!(selfProfile && selfProfile.photo_url); %>

          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-1 flex-col">
            <form method="post" action="/people/profile-photo" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="flex flex-col gap-3" id="profilePhotoForm">
              <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/settings#profile-photo">
              <input id="profilePhotoInput" type="file" name="profile_photo" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/gif" class="block w-full rounded-2xl border border-sky-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm file:mr-3 file:rounded-xl file:border-0 file:bg-sky-100 file:px-3 file:py-2 file:font-bold file:text-sky-700 hover:file:bg-sky-200 dark:border-sky-900/70 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200 dark:file:bg-sky-900/40 dark:file:text-sky-200">
              <div id="profilePhotoPreviewWrap" class="hidden w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-sky-200/80 bg-sky-50/70 px-4 py-3 dark:border-sky-900/60 dark:bg-sky-950/20">
                <img id="profilePhotoPreview" alt="Prévia da sua foto" class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-sky-200 dark:ring-sky-800/70">
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                  <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">Prévia da fotinha</div>
                  <p id="profilePhotoHint" class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium leading-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Escolheu? Aí é só salvar que ela sobe lindona.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-sky-200/80 bg-white/80 p-3 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 shadow-sm dark:border-sky-900/60 dark:bg-slate-900/70 dark:text-slate-300">
                Escolha com calma, ajuste do seu jeitinho e salve quando estiver curtindo o resultado.
              </div>
            </form>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-stretch justify-end gap-3 pt-4">
              <% if (showUseDefaultButton) { %>
                <form method="post" action="/people/profile-photo/use-default" class="shrink-0">
                  <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/settings#profile-photo">
                  <button type="submit" class="inline-flex min-h-[46px] items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black text-slate-700 transition-all hover:bg-slate-50 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-800">Usar foto padrão</button>
                </form>
              <% } %>
              <% if (showRemoveButton) { %>
                <form method="post" action="/people/profile-photo/remove" class="shrink-0">
                  <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/settings#profile-photo">
                  <button type="submit" class="inline-flex min-h-[46px] items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 bg-rose-50/70 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black text-rose-700 transition-all hover:bg-rose-100/80 dark:border-rose-900/70 dark:bg-rose-950/20 dark:text-rose-200 dark:hover:bg-rose-950/35">Excluir foto</button>
                </form>
              <% } %>
              <button form="profilePhotoForm" id="profilePhotoSubmit" type="submit" class="inline-flex min-h-[46px] items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-sky-600 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-sky-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60 shrink-0">Salvar foto</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

        <div id="profilePhotoCropModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[120] hidden items-center justify-center overflow-y-auto p-4 sm:p-6" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-950/70 backdrop-blur-sm" data-profile-photo-modal-close></div>
          <div class="relative my-auto w-full max-w-3xl rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-2xl dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 sm:p-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">Ajuste sua fotinha</div>
                <h4 class="mt-2 text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Escolha o melhor enquadramento</h4>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Arraste para posicionar, puxe o zoom se quiser e deixe seu rosto bem no centro do crachá.</p>
              </div>
              <button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-black text-slate-600 transition hover:bg-slate-50 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-800" data-profile-photo-modal-close>Fechar</button>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-5 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_18rem] lg:items-start">
              <div>
                <div id="profilePhotoCropStage" class="relative mx-auto aspect-square w-full max-w-[26rem] overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 shadow-inner dark:border-slate-700 touch-none select-none">
                  <img id="profilePhotoCropImage" alt="Ajuste da foto" class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 max-w-none will-change-transform pointer-events-none select-none" draggable="false">
                  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/35"></div>
                  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,transparent_0,transparent_56%,rgba(15,23,42,0.42)_100%)]"></div>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-3 text-xs font-medium leading-5 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Dica amiga: se tiver mais gente na foto, arraste até deixar você no centro. A moldura redonda é só a prévia — o recorte sai certinho daqui.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-[24px] border border-sky-200/80 bg-sky-50/70 p-4 shadow-sm dark:border-sky-900/60 dark:bg-sky-950/20">
                <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">Como vai ficar</div>
                <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-center">
                  <div class="relative h-28 w-28 overflow-hidden rounded-full border-4 border-white bg-slate-200 shadow-lg ring-1 ring-sky-200 dark:border-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:ring-sky-900/70">
                    <img id="profilePhotoCropPreview" alt="Prévia circular da foto" class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 max-w-none will-change-transform pointer-events-none select-none" draggable="false">
                  </div>
                </div>
                <label class="mt-5 block">
                  <span class="mb-2 block text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Zoom</span>
                  <input id="profilePhotoCropZoom" type="range" min="1" max="3" step="0.01" value="1" class="h-2 w-full cursor-pointer appearance-none rounded-full bg-sky-100 accent-sky-600 dark:bg-slate-800">
                </label>
                <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-3">
                  <button type="button" id="profilePhotoCropApply" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-sky-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-sky-700">Usar essa foto</button>
                  <button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-slate-700 transition-all hover:bg-slate-50 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-800" data-profile-photo-modal-close>Escolher outra depois</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="alerts" class="scroll-mt-28 mb-8 rounded-[32px] border border-sky-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm dark:border-sky-900/50 dark:bg-slate-800 sm:p-6 xl:mx-auto xl:max-w-[80rem]">
      <div class="mb-5">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">Alertas</div>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Escolha o que merece tocar o sino</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Os grupos continuam os mesmos. Só tiramos essa escolha do meio da sua rede para ela respirar melhor.</p>
      </div>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
            <div class="rounded-[26px] border border-sky-100 bg-sky-50/80 p-4 shadow-sm dark:border-sky-900/50 dark:bg-sky-950/20">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3">
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-sky-200 bg-white/90 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-700 shadow-sm dark:border-sky-800 dark:bg-slate-900/80 dark:text-sky-200">Seus alertas</span>
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/80 bg-white/80 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-600 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/70 dark:text-slate-300"><%= notificationPreferenceEnabledCount %>/<%= notificationPreferenceTotalCount %> grupos ligados</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" data-push-toggle data-push-toggle-variant="compact" data-push-public-key="<%= pushPublicKey %>" data-push-status-target="#selfNotificationPushStatus" class="op-btn op-btn-warning-soft op-btn--compact shrink-0 self-start sm:self-auto whitespace-nowrap">Ativar alertas</button>
              </div>
              <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Escolha seus alertas</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Os checks valem na sua conta. O botão ao lado liga só este aparelho.</p>
              <p id="selfNotificationPushStatus" class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Ligue este aparelho para receber novidades.</p>
            </div>

            <form method="post" action="/people/notification-preferences" class="space-y-4">
              <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/settings#alerts">
              <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[26px] border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/80">
                <% notificationPreferenceGroups.forEach((group, index) => { 
                     const groupCopy = notificationPreferenceCopy[group.key] || {};
                     const groupTitle = groupCopy.title || group.title;
                     const groupDescription = groupCopy.description || group.description;
                %>
                  <label class="group flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 transition-colors hover:bg-sky-50/60 dark:hover:bg-sky-950/20">
                    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                      <div class="text-[13px] font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white"><%= groupTitle %></div>
                      <p class="mt-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium leading-4.5 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><%= groupDescription %></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 pl-2">
                      <span class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><%= group.enabled ? 'Ligado' : 'Pausado' %></span>
                      <input type="checkbox" name="pref_<%= group.key %>" value="1" <%= group.enabled ? 'checked' : '' %> class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 rounded-md border-slate-300 text-sky-600 focus:ring-sky-500 dark:border-slate-600 dark:bg-slate-950">
                    </div>
                  </label>
                  <% if (index < notificationPreferenceGroups.length - 1) { %>
                    <div class="mx-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700/80"></div>
                  <% } %>
                <% }) %>
              </div>

              <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[24px] border border-dashed border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 px-4 py-3 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/60 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
                <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Os grupos ficam salvos na sua conta. O sininho do topo continua abrindo a central completa.</p>
                <button type="submit" class="inline-flex w-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/15 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-slate-800 dark:bg-amber-500 dark:text-slate-950 dark:hover:bg-amber-400 sm:w-auto whitespace-nowrap">Salvar alertas</button>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>

    </section>

      <form method="post" action="/people" id="pix" class="mb-8 xl:col-span-2 rounded-[32px] border border-violet-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm dark:border-violet-900/50 dark:bg-slate-800 sm:p-6 xl:mx-auto xl:max-w-[80rem]">
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="<%= selfProfile.id %>">
          <input type="hidden" name="profile_section" value="pix">
          <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/settings#pix">

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-300">Receber por Pix</div>
              <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Seu Pix pronto para receber</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Aqui você decide se quer deixar seu Pix pronto para quando alguém for te pagar.</p>
            </div>
            <% if (selfProfile.pix_enabled && selfProfile.pix_valid) { %>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:border-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 dark:text-emerald-200">Pronto para uso</span>
            <% } else if (selfProfile.pix_enabled) { %>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-amber-700 dark:border-amber-800 dark:bg-amber-900/20 dark:text-amber-200">Pedindo um ajuste</span>
            <% } else { %>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/70 dark:text-slate-300">Ainda desligado</span>
            <% } %>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(280px,0.82fr)_minmax(0,1.18fr)] xl:items-start">
            <div class="grid gap-4">
              <div class="rounded-[26px] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 px-4 py-4 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/70 sm:px-5">
                <label class="flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-3">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="pix_enabled" id="selfPixEnabled" value="1" class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 rounded border-violet-300 text-violet-600 focus:ring-violet-500" <%= selfPixEnabled ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                  <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                    <span class="block text-sm font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Deixar Pix pronto por aqui</span>
                    <span class="mt-1 block text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Sua chave fica escondidinha na lista e só aparece inteira na hora de copiar.</span>
                  </span>
                </label>
              </div>

              <div class="rounded-[26px] border border-violet-200/70 bg-violet-50/80 px-4 py-4 shadow-sm dark:border-violet-900/50 dark:bg-violet-950/20 sm:px-5">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white/95 text-violet-600 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-violet-100 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-violet-300 dark:ring-violet-900/50" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 9V7a5 5 0 00-10 0v2m-2 0h14a1 1 0 011 1v9a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1v-9a1 1 0 011-1zm7 4h.01"></path></svg>
                  </span>
                  <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                    <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-violet-600/80 dark:text-violet-300/80">Resumo atual</div>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                      <% if (selfProfile.pix_enabled) { %>
                        <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100"><%= (selfProfile.pix_key_type_label || 'Chave Pix') + ' · ' + (selfProfile.pix_masked_key || 'aguardando preenchimento') %></strong>.
                        <% if (selfProfile.pix_city) { %>
                          Cidade do Pix: <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100"><%= selfProfile.pix_city %><%= selfProfile.pix_state ? ' / ' + selfProfile.pix_state : '' %></strong>.
                        <% } %>
                        Esse é o Pix que aparece quando alguém precisa te pagar.
                      <% } else { %>
                        Nenhuma chave salva por aqui ainda. Quando você ligar isso, quem for te pagar já encontra seu Pix sem correria.
                      <% } %>
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid gap-4">
              <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2" data-self-pix-field>
                <label class="block">
                  <span class="mb-2 block text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Tipo da chave</span>
                  <select name="pix_key_type" id="selfPixKeyType" class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-violet-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-colors focus:border-violet-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-violet-100 dark:border-violet-900 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:focus:border-violet-500 dark:focus:ring-violet-500/20">
                    <option value="">Escolha um tipo</option>
                    <option value="cpf" <%= selfPixKeyType === 'cpf' ? 'selected' : '' %>>CPF</option>
                    <option value="cnpj" <%= selfPixKeyType === 'cnpj' ? 'selected' : '' %>>CNPJ</option>
                    <option value="email" <%= selfPixKeyType === 'email' ? 'selected' : '' %>>E-mail</option>
                    <option value="phone" <%= selfPixKeyType === 'phone' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Celular</option>
                    <option value="evp" <%= selfPixKeyType === 'evp' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Chave aleatória</option>
                  </select>
                </label>

                <label class="block">
                  <span class="mb-2 block text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Chave Pix</span>
                  <input name="pix_key_value" id="selfPixKeyValue" value="<%- selfPixKeyValueInput %>" class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-violet-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-colors focus:border-violet-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-violet-100 dark:border-violet-900 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:focus:border-violet-500 dark:focus:ring-violet-500/20" placeholder="Ex.: 21999999999" inputmode="text" autocomplete="off">
                  <p id="selfPixKeyHelp" class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium leading-5 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Se for celular, pode mandar só DDD + número, com ou sem máscara. O +55 entra por nossa conta.</p>
                </label>
              </div>

              <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.7fr)_minmax(0,1fr)]" data-self-pix-field>
                <label class="block">
                  <span class="mb-2 block text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Estado</span>
                  <select name="pix_state" id="selfPixState" class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-violet-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-colors focus:border-violet-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-violet-100 dark:border-violet-900 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:focus:border-violet-500 dark:focus:ring-violet-500/20">
                    <% pixStateList.forEach((stateEntry) => { const stateCode = getPixStateCode(stateEntry); const stateLabel = getPixStateLabel(stateEntry); if (!stateCode) return; %>
                      <option value="<%= stateCode %>" <%= selfPixState === stateCode ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= stateLabel %></option>
                    <% }) %>
                  </select>
                </label>

                <label class="block">
                  <span class="mb-2 block text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Cidade</span>
                  <input name="pix_city" id="selfPixCity" value="<%- selfPixCity %>" list="selfPixCitySuggestions" class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-violet-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-colors focus:border-violet-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-violet-100 dark:border-violet-900 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:focus:border-violet-500 dark:focus:ring-violet-500/20" placeholder="Cidade do recebedor">
                  <datalist id="selfPixCitySuggestions"></datalist>
                </label>
              </div>

              <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] lg:items-end">
                <label class="block" data-self-pix-field>
                  <span class="mb-2 block text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Nome que aparece no Pix</span>
                  <input name="pix_label" id="selfPixLabel" value="<%- selfPixLabel %>" class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-violet-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-colors focus:border-violet-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-violet-100 dark:border-violet-900 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:focus:border-violet-500 dark:focus:ring-violet-500/20" placeholder="Ex.: João - AcerttaPay">
                </label>

                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 lg:items-end lg:self-end">
                  <div id="selfPixDormantHint" class="rounded-[24px] border border-dashed border-violet-200 bg-violet-50/70 px-4 py-4 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:border-violet-900/50 dark:bg-violet-950/20 dark:text-slate-300 lg:max-w-[24rem] <%= selfPixEnabled ? 'hidden' : '' %>">
                    <div class="font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Pode deixar desligado sem problema.</div>
                    <p class="mt-2">Quando quiser, é só ligar, preencher e salvar.</p>
                  </div>
                  <button type="submit" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center self-start rounded-2xl bg-violet-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-violet-500/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-violet-700 sm:w-auto lg:self-end">Salvar meu Pix</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>


    <section id="security" class="scroll-mt-28 xl:mx-auto xl:max-w-[80rem]">
        <section id="app-security" class="xl:col-span-2 rounded-[32px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 sm:p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Segurança do app</div>
              <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">PIN e bloqueio por inatividade</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Aqui você decide se o app pede um PIN numérico para abrir e depois de quanto tempo ele volta a travar sozinho.</p>
            </div>
            <% if (appPinEnabled) { %>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:border-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 dark:text-emerald-200">PIN ligado</span>
            <% } else { %>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/70 dark:text-slate-300">PIN desligado</span>
            <% } %>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4">
            <div class="grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-2 xl:items-stretch">
              <div class="h-full rounded-[26px] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 px-4 py-4 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/70 sm:px-5">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200 dark:ring-slate-700" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 11c0-.967.784-1.75 1.75-1.75S15.5 10.033 15.5 11c0 .645-.35 1.208-.87 1.51-.358.208-.63.57-.63.98V15m-4-4V8a4 4 0 118 0v3m-10 0h12a1 1 0 011 1v7a1 1 0 01-1 1H7a1 1 0 01-1-1v-7a1 1 0 011-1z"></path></svg>
                  </span>
                  <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                    <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Resumo atual</div>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                      <% if (appPinEnabled) { %>
                        O app já pede PIN para destravar e hoje está configurado para bloquear <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100"><%= appPinIdleLabel %></strong>.
                      <% } else { %>
                        Hoje ele abre direto, sem pedir PIN. Se quiser, você pode ligar essa proteção e deixar a tela financeira mais resguardada.
                      <% } %>
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-[26px] border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-4 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/70 sm:px-5">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-center">
                  <% if (!appPinEnabled) { %>
                    <button type="button" data-app-pin-open="create" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/15 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-slate-800 dark:bg-amber-500 dark:text-slate-950 dark:hover:bg-amber-400">Ativar PIN</button>
                  <% } else { %>
                    <button type="button" data-app-pin-open="change" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/15 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-slate-800 dark:bg-amber-500 dark:text-slate-950 dark:hover:bg-amber-400">Trocar PIN</button>
                    <form method="post" action="/lock/engage" class="contents sm:contents">
                      <input type="hidden" name="reason" value="manual">
                      <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/settings#security">
                      <button type="submit" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-slate-700 transition-all hover:bg-slate-50 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800">Bloquear agora</button>
                    </form>
                    <button type="button" data-app-pin-open="idle" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-slate-700 transition-all hover:bg-slate-50 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800">Tempo de bloqueio</button>
                    <button type="button" data-app-pin-open="disable" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-rose-700 transition-all hover:bg-rose-50 dark:border-rose-900 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-rose-300 dark:hover:bg-rose-900/20">Desligar PIN</button>
                  <% } %>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Seu PIN pode ter de <%= appPinMinLength %> a <%= appPinMaxLength %> dígitos. A recomendação amiga é usar <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100">6 números</strong> e fugir de combinações óbvias, tipo 1234, 0000 ou repeteco.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-2 xl:items-stretch">
              <div class="h-full rounded-[26px] border border-sky-200/70 bg-sky-50/80 px-4 py-4 shadow-sm dark:border-sky-900/50 dark:bg-sky-950/20 sm:px-5">
                <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">Como isso se comporta</div>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Depois de ligado, o app trava sozinho ao abrir de novo ou quando passa do tempo que você escolher. Se esquecer o PIN, na tela de bloqueio dá para confirmar sua conta Google e redefinir por lá.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="h-full rounded-[26px] border border-dashed border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 px-4 py-4 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/60 dark:text-slate-300 sm:px-5">
                <div class="font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Dica boa para não se enrolar</div>
                <p class="mt-2">Se em algum momento esse PIN sumir da cabeça, tenta destravar normalmente. Se não rolar, a tela de bloqueio oferece a saída com Google para você redefinir sem ficar preso.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-[26px] border border-violet-200/70 bg-violet-50/80 px-4 py-4 shadow-sm dark:border-violet-900/50 dark:bg-violet-950/20 sm:px-5">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                    <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-300">Desbloqueio pelo aparelho</div>
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-violet-200 bg-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black text-violet-700 dark:border-violet-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70 dark:text-violet-200"><%= appPasskeyCount %>/<%= appPasskeyMaxCount || 6 %> aparelhos</span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Se o aparelho topar, dá para usar digital, rosto ou a proteção dele para abrir o app. O PIN continua ali como plano B.</p>
                </div>
                <% if (appPasskeyState.canRegister) { %>
                  <button type="button" id="appPasskeyRegisterButton" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-violet-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-violet-500/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-violet-700 sm:w-auto sm:shrink-0">Adicionar neste aparelho</button>
                <% } else if (appPasskeyState.limitReached) { %>
                  <div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-amber-700 dark:border-amber-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70 dark:text-amber-200 sm:shrink-0">Você já chegou no limite de aparelhos por aqui.</div>
                <% } %>
              </div>

              <p id="appPasskeyFeedback" class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300"><%= appPasskeyState.helpText || 'Quando quiser, dá para preparar este aparelho para destravar o app com um toque mais esperto.' %></p>

              <% if (appPasskeyItems.length) { %>
                <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 lg:grid-cols-2">
                  <% appPasskeyItems.forEach((item) => { %>
                    <div class="h-full rounded-[22px] border border-white/80 bg-white/90 px-4 py-4 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
                      <div class="flex h-full flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
                        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                            <div class="truncate text-sm font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white"><%= item.label %></div>
                            <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold <%= item.badgeTone === 'emerald' ? 'border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 dark:border-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 dark:text-emerald-200' : 'border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300' %>"><%= item.badgeLabel %></span>
                          </div>
                          <div class="mt-2 grid gap-1 text-xs font-semibold leading-5 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 sm:grid-cols-2">
                            <p>Preparado em <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200"><%= item.createdAtLabel || 'agora há pouco' %></strong></p>
                            <p><%= item.hasBeenUsed ? 'Último uso em' : 'Ainda não foi usado para destravar' %> <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200"><%= item.hasBeenUsed ? item.lastUsedAtLabel : '—' %></strong></p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <form method="post" action="/people/security/passkeys/<%= item.id %>/delete" data-confirm-prompt="Remover <%= item.label %> da lista de desbloqueio? O PIN continua funcionando normalmente." class="sm:shrink-0">
                          <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/settings#security">
                          <button type="submit" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black text-rose-700 transition-all hover:bg-rose-50 dark:border-rose-900 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-rose-300 dark:hover:bg-rose-900/20 sm:w-auto">Remover</button>
                        </form>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  <% }) %>
                </div>
              <% } %>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div id="appPinManageModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[130] hidden items-center justify-center overflow-y-auto p-4 sm:p-6" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="appPinManageTitle" aria-describedby="appPinManageHint appPinRulesHint">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-950/70 backdrop-blur-sm" data-app-pin-close></div>
          <div class="relative my-auto w-full max-w-lg rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-2xl dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 sm:p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
              <div>
                <div class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Segurança do app</div>
                <h4 id="appPinManageTitle" class="mt-2 text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Criar PIN</h4>
                <p id="appPinManageHint" class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Escolha um PIN numérico para proteger a abertura do app.</p>
              </div>
              <button type="button" class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-500 transition hover:bg-slate-50 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-800" data-app-pin-close aria-label="Fechar">✕</button>
            </div>

            <p id="appPinRulesHint" class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-sky-200 bg-sky-50 px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold leading-5 text-sky-700 dark:border-sky-900/60 dark:bg-sky-950/20 dark:text-sky-200">Para manter a proteção mais esperta, combinações muito óbvias como 1234, 0000 ou sequências repetidas não passam.</p>

            <form method="post" action="/people/security/pin/setup" class="mt-5 grid gap-4" id="appPinManageForm" autocomplete="off">
